5:27 CA064 [critical/medium] `danger_accept_invalid_certs(true)` inside a condition: TLS certificate validation is switched off when that condition holds, so any server is accepted
13:10 CA064 [critical/low] `danger_accept_invalid_certs(..)` with a value that is not a constant: TLS certificate validation is switched off whenever that value says so
23:11 CA064 [critical/medium] `set_verify(SslVerifyMode::NONE)`: the peer's certificate is not checked, so any server is accepted
